{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Make feeding seagulls a criminal offence & introduce fines",
        "additional_details": "Feeding seagulls can unsettle people\u2019s lives, which include impacting people\u2019s sleep quality due to being woken up by seagulls, as well as seagulls scratching car roofs, damaging plants, and fouling in gardens, cars and paths which can act as a health hazard. In addition, it can impact people\u2019s quality of life, especially when seagulls swoop down towards adults and children.\r\n \r\nIn addition, feeding seagulls can result in rats and other vermin being attracted. The feeding of seagulls has become a serious issue not just for myself, but for many residents in my local community.",
        "background": "I would like the Government to pass a law that makes feeding seagulls a criminal offence and introduce fines for people who breach this law.",
